## 5. List of Components Used and Their Purpose

| Component | Quantity | Purpose |
| :--- | :-: | :--- |
| **Arduino-compatible board (ESP32-based)** | 1 | Main sensor node controller; reads sensor data and publishes to MQTT broker via Wi-Fi |
| **DHT11 Temperature & Humidity Sensor** | 1 | Measures ambient temperature (°C) and relative humidity (%) for the plant environment |
| **HW-390 Capacitive Soil Moisture Sensor** | 1 | Detects soil moisture level via ADC; provides analog readings converted to percentage for watering decisions |
| **Light Sensor (LDR-based module)** | 1 | Measures ambient light intensity (%) to assess whether the plant receives adequate illumination |
| **ESP32-S3-CAM Development Board** | 1 | Voice agent hardware with onboard Wi-Fi, camera interface, I²S audio, and SPI display support |
| **OV3660 Camera Module** | 1 | Onboard camera for capturing plant images; enables AI visual analysis of plant health |
| **INMP441 MEMS Digital Microphone** | 1 | I²S digital microphone for voice input; captures user speech for natural language interaction |
| **MAX98357 I²S Audio Amplifier** | 1 | Digital audio amplifier for driving the speaker; converts I²S data to analog audio output |
| **Speaker** | 1 | Outputs spoken responses and care advice generated by the AI agent |
| **1.54" IPS LCD Display (240×240, SPI)** | 1 | Displays conversation messages, sensor data, and system status on the device |
| **MQTT Broker (Mosquitto)** | 1 (software) | Message broker for lightweight publish/subscribe communication between sensor node and cloud |
| **OpenClaw Agent** | 1 (software) | Cloud-based AI agent that analyzes sensor data, maintains plant care knowledge, and generates reports |
| **xiaozhi Agent Firmware** | 1 (software) | ESP32 voice agent firmware handling wake word detection, STT/TTS, and MCP protocol communication |
| **FastMCP Server** | 1 (software) | MCP protocol bridge enabling xiaozhi to query OpenClaw for real-time plant care advice |

